                            <comment id="16146941" author="v.pyatkov" created="Wed, 30 Aug 2017 09:21:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have prepared a solution with will be allow to workarounded the issue.&lt;br/&gt;
All server nodes should add a JVM flag:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;-DIGNITE_DISABLE_P2P_DEPLOYMENT_OWNERSHIP=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by default value is &lt;em&gt;false&lt;/em&gt; (standard behavior).&lt;br/&gt;
It will not allow any server assign &lt;tt&gt;locDepOwner&lt;/tt&gt; flag as &lt;em&gt;true&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
Look at upper PR.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
